  "body": "A step in the “fire a DND event” algorithm referred back to an action\noccuring in the “first step” of the algorithm, but since the time when\nthat reference was first made, additional steps were apparently added to\nthe beginning of the algorithm such that what had been the first step is\nnow step 3. So this change just updates it to refer to “step 3” instead.",
